# Every knob at its limits (resonator ignores filter and resonance) on a loud sweep: no blow-up at the longest
# decay with a fully inharmonic string; then dry only (pan 0) must still pass sound.
tempo 120
steps 16
tail 0.5
track fx1
input sweep 30 16000 0.9
preset 255 255 0 0 255 0 0 0 0 255 255 255 0 0 0 0 0 0
gain 1
note 0 C2 16
param pan 0 12
expect sound 0 16
expect peak_below 0
